49:
Wa fuluka ngaashi omeva; ndelenee ove ito ka kala omukulunhu,
osheshi owa londa kombete yaxo;
osho we i nyateka--ove wa londa kombete yange.

15:
Nomepangelonghono loye ove to denge poshi ovatondi voye.
Ove to pitifa mo oupyuhandu woye;
wo tau va lungwinifa ngaashi omwiidi.

Ndele mouwanghenda woye ove wa endifa
oshiwana shoye we shi kulila;
neenghono doye we va fikifa konhele yoye iyapuki.

Eehamba domuEdom da haluka,
ovakulunhu vaMoab va kwatwa kekakamo;
oonakukala aveshe muKaanan ova dekweta.

24:
Osho ngaha omuudi weendjovo daKalunga ta popi;
ou ta mono omamoniko Omunaenghono adishe;
ou ta wile poshi ndele e nomesho a pashuka.

Osho ngaha omuudi weendjovo daKalunga ta popi;
heeno ou a shiiva ounongo waau wOkombadambada;
ou ta mono omamoniko Omunaenghono adishe,
ou ta wile poshi a kukuka ndee ta pashuka vali.

22:
Ohandi ifana Omwene,
nokovatondi vange ota xupifa nge;
Omwene na hambelelwe.

Omwifi wa lundumuka meyulu laye,
nomundilo womokanya kaye wa lungwinifa po;
nomutemo womakala owa ndwafuka muye.

Ndele ove ho xupifa ovanhu ve lininipika
ndelenee omesho oye e nondubo novalinenepeki;
oto va xutula.

3:
Onda li nda nangala, nda kofa nawa,
opo nee nda penduka;
osheshi Kalunga oha amene nge.

Omwene, yambuka, xupife nge Kalunga kange!
Osheshi Ove wa teyaula oluhamama lovatondi vange;
nomayoo ovalunde we a tataula.

4:
Handukeni, ndelenee inamu nyona;
popyeni momitima deni momitala deni
nokulimwenenena. Sela

5:
Omwene, ongula inene to ka uda ondaka yange;
ongula inene ohandi ku lilongekidile efiyawilo
nohandi liameke kwoove.

Ovapopi voipupulu oto va nyonauna po;
ovalumenhu ovadipai novanekonda
oho va tondo.

Omwene, endife nge
pauyuki woye molwovatondi vange;
palele nge ondjila yoye komesho yange.

Osheshi momakanya avo
kamu na okulineekelwa,
meni lavo otava dutu enyonauko;
ominino davo odo eembila da yeuluka;
nomalaka avo oku na omufenhu.

6:
Onda loloka molwomanyemato ange aeshe;
keshe oufiku ohandi tutike omutala wange,
nomulele wange ohandi u talaleke nomahodi ange.

Ovalongi vowii amushe nye,
djeni po pwaame amushe!
Osheshi Omwene okwa uda ekwenauko lange;

Ovatondi vange aveshe otava ka lengaifwa
ndele tava kanghwa;
otava shunifwa diva lwanima va fya ohoni.

7:
Omwene, Kalunga kange,
mwoove ohandi tula elineekelo lange;
kwafe nge kovataataai vange aveshe u xupife nge,

8:
Owe mu pa epangelo
kombada yoilongwa yomake oye;
ashishe owe shi tula koshi yeemhadi daye:

9:
Ovatondi ova nyonwa po,
va shatwa po fiyo alushe;
noilando yavo Ove we i ngumauna po sheke;
okudimbulukiwa kwavo kwa xula po.

10:
Osheshi omukehenakalunga
ote litadele oiningwa yokahalu kaye;
ndele omunalwisho ta sheke Omwene.

Meendjila daye efimbo alishe ota mono ouwa;
nomatokolo oye a fa e li kokule naye ngaashi eulu,
ovakondjifi vaye aveshe ote va tauluka.

Ote lipopile momutima waye, ta ti:
“Itandi ka punduka nande;
fiyo alushe itandi ka hangika komupya.”

Mokanya kaye omwa yada efingotukano,
nomaketuketu omafininiko;
koshi yelaka laye oku nehanauko nowii.

Ota hondjaunine pomikunda meenhele da fita,
opo a dipae omuyuki;
omesho aye otaa mono omunamupya.

Oye ta hondama mengade
ngaashi onghoshi monhele yayo;
ta nangele a kwate epongo;
ta kwata epongo moku li yula
meendjadja daye;

Ove we shi mona nokuli;
osheshi okuningwa nai nokulilifwa,
oto shi dimbulukwa,
noto shi tambula shi kale momake oye;
to lineekelwa kwaau, ehe nomukwafi,
Oove omukwafi weefiye.

Omwene, Ove ho udu odjuulufi yovalininipiki;
Oove ho pameke omitima davo;
nokutwi kwoye to ku ehenifa kuvo,

11:
MOmwene onda tula mo elineekelo lange;
otamu ti hano ngahelipi kwaame:
“Tukeni keemhunda ngaashi odila!

Osheshi Omwene Oye omuyuki
noku hole ouyuki;
ovayuki notava ka tala oshipala shaye.

12:
ava hava ti: “Elaka letu olo eenghono detu;
omilungu detu tadi tu popile.
Olyelye omwene wetu?”

14:
Ndelenee aveshe va pumha mo,
aveshe va vayapala;
kape na ou ta longo ouwa, nande umwe.

16:
Alushe ohandi kwatele Omwene
koshipala shange;
eshi Ye e li kolulyo lange, ihandi tengauka.

Ove to shiivifile nge ondjila yomwenyo;
ouyadihafo ou li koshipala shoye,
ouwapalinyenye ou li meke lokolulyo loye fiyo alushe.

17:
Kwoove naku dje oshitokolifo
shokutokola nge;
omesho oye taa tale eshi sha yukilila.

18:
Ohandi ifana Omwene,
nokovatondi vange ota xupifa nge;
Omwene na hambelelwe!

Ndelenee mokukala naye
nda li ndihe na ombudi,
nonda li nde lilungamena koilonga ii;

Osheshi Ove to efele olamba yange okuminikila;
Omwene Kalunga kange
ota minikile momulaulu wange.

Ondjila yaKalunga oya wanenena;
ondjovo yaKalunga oya yelifwa;
Oye oshikelelifo shaaveshe
ava have liameke kuye.

Kalunga okwa pa nge okufinda
ovatondadi vange;
a tula oiwana koshi yange,

19:
Etilo lOmwene ola yela;
tali kalelele fiyo alushe.
Eemhangela dOmwene odo oshili;
adishe oda yukilila.

Omupiya woye ote liefele yo
okulondwelwa kudo;
moku di diinina, otamu di ondjabi inene.

22:
“Okwe lineekela Omwene,
Oye ne mu xupife, Ye e mu kufe ko;
osheshi Ye e mu hokwa, vati.”

Akutu, eembwa da dingilila nge,
etanga lovanawii ola fitikinina nge mo;
ova tyuula omake neemhadi dange;

23:
Ota hekeleke omwenyo wange;
ota endifa nge mondjila ya yuka
molwedina laye.

25:
Kalunga kange, Oove tuu, handi lineekele;
ino efa nge ndi fifwe ohoni,
opo ovayelani vange vaha hafele nge.

27:
Omwene, Oye ouyelele wange nexupifolao lange;
Olyelye ndi tile ngeno?
Omwene, Oye ohote yokukalamwenyo kwange;
olyelye ta mbadapalifa nge vali?

28:
Xupifa oshiwana shoye,
nangeka noupuna oshitukulwafyuululwa shoye;
va lifa noku va humbata fiyo alushe.

29:
Ondaka yOmwene oi li kombada yomeva;
Kalunga kefimano ota pwalakata;
Omwene e li kombada yomeva manene.

Ondaka yOmwene otai teyaula omiti domisederi;
heeno, Omwene ta teyaula
omisederi domuLibanon;

Ondaka yOmwene otai helulifa eemenye
ndele tai yaumukifa omifitu;
ndelenee motembeli yaye, ashishe tashi ti: “Vadivadi!”

Omwene okwa li omutumba kombada yeyelumeva;
heeno; Omwene ha kala omutumba kolukalwapangelo,
ngaashi ohamba fiyo alushe.

30:
Omwene, molwohokwe yoye
wa pamekela nge omhunda yange;
ndele eshi wa holeka oshipala shoye, onda haluka.

opo omwenyo wange u shiive oku ku imbila, itau loloka;
Omwene, Kalunga kange,
fiyo alushe handi ke ku hambelela!

31:
Omwene, kwoove oko nde uya okuhondama;
ino fifa nge nande ohoni.
Xupife nge molwouyuki woye.

Oove emanya lange nohote yange;
molwedina loye oto ka endifa nge,
ndele to kwatele nge komesho,

Omhepo yange ohandi i yandje momake oye;
Ove wa kulila nge, Omwene,
Kalunga omudiinini.

32:
Oove oshihondamwa shange,
to amene nge koudjuu;
oto dingililifa nge nehafo lexupifo. Sela

Onda hala ndi ku longe,
ndi ku udikile ondjila, ei u nokweenda nayo;
onda hala ndi ku twe omayele;
eisho lange tali ku pashukile.

35:
ouwa ou nde va ningila,
vo otave u pilulile nge owii;
omwenyo wange tau nyika oupongo.

Vo itava popi eendjovo tadi eta ombili,
ndelenee ava ve hole ombili moshilongo,
otave va dutile eendaka dowii;

36:
Ovo hava kutifwa keondo longulu yoye;
Ove to va itavelele okunwa
momulonga wounyenye woye.

37:
Alushe ye omunalukeno
ndele ta yandje oikolo;
oludalo laye otali eta enangeko noupuna.

39:
Osho nda li nda mwena, nda tya filu,
inandi popya yo eshi shiwa;
ndelenee ouyehame wange wa hapupala meni lange.

Omunhu ota endaenda a fa ashike omudidimbe;
te lipyakidile ashike;
emona otali tuvikilwa,
ndele ou te li kufa mo, ke shiivike.

40:
Oye okwa shila nge mo melambo lenyonauno
nomonhata yonhopo;
okwa kaleka eemhadi dange kemanya,
eenghatu dange okwe di pameka;

Oilonga inene Ove wa longa,
Omwene, Kalunga kange,
noikumwifa yoye neemhangela kufye;
kape na eshi tashi yelekwa naave;
ngeno nda hala oku i udifa noku i vilikila,
ndele yo ihapu, itai dulika okuvalwa.

Oitomenwayambo neendjayambo ito di hokwa,
ndelenee omatwi ange wa fitulula;
exwikiloyambo netimbayambo ito pula.

Eshi shouyuki onde shi udifa meongalo linene;
tala, omilungu dange inandi di mwenifa;
Omwene, Oove mwene u shi shii.

41:
Ngeenge umwe te uya okutalela nge po,
ota tongo oipupulu;
omutima waye otau likola oumbudi;
ngeenge a pita mo,
otau shi mu hepaululifa mondjila.

44:
Osheshi hauta wange handi lineekele,
ndele hamukonda wange
tau va taataifa nge;

Ngeno kwa li twa dimbwa shili edina laKalunga ketu,
ndele hatu nanene omake etu
kukalunga kamwe ke lili;

45:
Ove, owa wapala u dule ovakwadu aveshe mouwa;
ewapalonyenye ola tilwa komilungu doye;
osho Kalunga e ku nangeka noupuna fiyo alushe.

Oikuti yoye oi neememo.
Oiwana tai wile koshi yoye;
ovatondi vohamba otave i yashwa momitima.

Ove u hole ouyuki ndele to tondo oumbudi;
onghee hano Kalunga, Kalunga koye,
e ku vaeka nomaadi ehafo u dule oovakweni.

Omona okakadona, pwilikina,
tala oku, ove endeka okutwi kwoye;
xupula oshiwana sheni novambuleni.

Okakadona kohamba,
aka ke li meni leumbo, kawa muko vene,
momudjalo wako omo mwa tungilwa oingoldo;

48:
nokutya: “Kalunga ou, Oye tuu Kalunga ketu
alushe fiyo alushe;
note tu endifa fiyo omokufya.”

49:
Ndelenee omwenyo wange,
Kalunga ote u kulile mo mepangelo lomoshovafi;
osheshi Oye omukombeleli wange. Sela

50:
Shimwe ashike, eshi inandi hala
okutambula eemhedi deumbo loye
noikombo yomoshuunda shoye;

osheshi oifitukuti aishe oyange,
osho yo oinamwenyo ei i li kombada yeemhunda
omayovi nomayovi, oyange;

Ngeno okwa li ndi nondjala,
ngeno itandi shi ku lombwele;
osheshi edu alishe nouyadi walo olange.

Hano etela Kalunga olupandu, olo tuu eyambo loye,
ou wOkombadambada
u mu wanifile omaudaneko oye;

51:
Opo nee omayambo ouyuki, oto ke a hokwa vali,
omaxwikiloyambo nomayambo oiwana;
neemhedi otadi tenhekwa koaltari yoye.

52:
Ndele ame ondi li mongulu yaKalunga,
nda fa olumono litalala;
nde lineekela efilonghenda laKalunga fiyo alushe.

Alushe onda hala ndi ku tangele, eshi we shi ninga;
nomoipafi yovayuki voye onda hala okuteelela
edina loye, osheshi olo oliwa.

53:
Opo tuu opo va tilifwa va kakama,
nande kapa li oshitilifi;
osheshi Kalunga okwa li a halakanifa
omakipa ovakondekeli voye;
ove we va xutula, osheshi Kalunga okwa li e va ekelashi.

54:
Osheshi ovanailongo ova shivila nge olwoodi,
ovakolokoshi otava nangele omwenyo wange;
Kalunga ihave mu tula moipafi yavo. Sela

55:
Osheshi hamutondi wange ta sheke nge;
ngeno oye, ngeno haxwe;
haumwe womovayelani te litadele nge;
ngeno oye, ngeno nda hondama;

Omwenyo wange ote u kulile,
u mone ombili, opo vaha hange nge;
osheshi ovo ve nondubo naame ovahapu.

56:
Ovatondi vange itava fuda okufulila nge meemhanda;
osheshi vahapu ve li po mokulitumba kwavo
otava ningile nge ondubo.

Kalunga ota tangifa nge ondjovo yaye;
ohandi lineekele Kalunga, itandi tila nande.
Ovanhu otava ningi nge shike!

57:
Omutima wange u nouladi, Kalunga,
omutima wange ou nouladi;
onda hala okwiimba nokushika.

58:
Ovahenakalunga ovo ovaefi, nghee va dalwa;
novanaipupulu ovapuki,
nghee va dja medimo laina.

Ndele taku tiwa: “Heeno, oshili, omuyuki
ota mono oshiimati nokuli;
heeno, oku na Kalunga, ou ha tokola kombada yedu.”

59:
Eenghono dange, Oove nda hala
ndi ku teelele, nde lididimika;
osheshi Kalunga Oye ohote yange.

Omakanya avo neendaka domilungu davo odo oulunde;
onghee hano elitumbo lavo nali ve likwatife voovene,
nomolwomafingaelo nomolwoipupulu ei tava kunu.

Eenghono dange, onda hala ndi ku imbile ehambelelo;
osheshi Kalunga Oye ohote yange,
Kalunga kange omunanghenda.

60:
Moab oshiyaxa shange shokulikoshela,
kombada yaEdom ohandi ekele ko eenghaku dange;
nohandi nyakukilwa Filistia.”

61:
Epangelo layo li kale alushe koshipala shaKalunga;
i pa ouwanghenda noudiinini,
u ninge eameno layo.

62:
Kalunga Oye aeke omwenyo wange
tau mu teelele mengungumano,
kuye otaku di ekwafo lange;

Oye aeke emanya lange, nehepuluko lange,
nohotemanya yange;
ame itandi tengauka nande.

Exupifo lange nefimano lange oli li muKalunga;
emanya lange la pama
nouhondameno wange Oye Kalunga.

Nosho yo, Omwene, ouwanghenda owoye;
nomunhu keshe Ove to mu ningile
shi fike pailonga yaye.

63:
Kalunga Oove Kalunga kange,
ongula inene ohandi ku kongo;
omwenyo wange we ku fila enota;
nolutu lange ole ku hala medu likukutu
la fya oluteni lihe nomeva.

Osheshi ouwanghenda woye ouwa,
u dule okukalamwenyo;
omilungu dange nadi ku tange.

Otava ka yandjwa komukonda wa twa;
otava ekelwashi,
va ninge eendja douvandje.

64:
vo va yashe omuyuki meholeko;
otave mu vakele oku mu yasha,
kave nouxwenge washa.

Omhangela yavo ii otave i diinine,
otava popi nhumbi tave mu tele omalulo meholeko;
otava diladila tava ti: “Olyelye te tu mono?”

65:
Oove wa wana okufimanekwa,
Ove, Kalunga muSion,
Oove u nokuwanifilwa omaudaneko;

Ove wa yavelela edu, to li tutike,
ndele oto li ningi la punapala unene,
nomulonga waKalunga u yadi omeva;
oto va menifile oilya;
osheshi osho ngaha to longekida edu.

Oyana nomilola oya djala omaufita eedi,
nomalufilu okwe lituvika noilya;
ope nenyakuko nokwiimba.

66:
Omeva efuta okwe a shitukifa edu likukutu,
opo ve li taulule kolupadi;
onghee nee twa kala twe mu hafela.

Meenghono daye ota pangele fiyo alushe;
omesho aye otaa pashukile oiwana yoilongo:
ovalundakani ite va efa va kulukute nande. Sela

68:
Omwene na pandulwe!
Efiku nefiku ohe tu humbata;
Kalunga Oye exupifo letu. Sela

69:
Osheshi ouladi wokukondjela ongulu yoye,
oo wa mana nge eenghono;
nomasheko aava have ku sheke, a wila nge.

Monhopo shile nge mo, ndiha ningine;
kwafa, ndi xupifwe kovatondi
nomoule womeva efuta,

Omwene, ude nge,
osheshi onghenda yoye oiwa, inyenye;
molwefilonghenda loye linene liameka kwaame.

Odino yange, nohoni yange nelengwa lange,
Ove u i shii;
ovafininiki vange aveshe ove shiivike kwoove.

71:
Oove omuyambididi wange, nghee nda dalwa;
Ove wa pitifa nge mekolo lameme.
Mefimbo alishe ohandi ku hambelele.

ndele tava ti: “Kalunga okwe mu efa;
mu shikuleni, nye mu mu kwate,
osheshi ke na omupopili.”

Okanya kange naka udife ouyuki woye,
nomafiku aeshe omadidiliko exupifo loye;
osheshi onda nyengwa oku a vala aeshe.

Kalunga, ouyuki woye otau fiki fiyo pombada keulu;
Ove ou ho longo oinenenima,
Kalunga, olyelye e ku fa?

Ove we tu monifa omaudjuu mahapu nomahepeko;
ndelenee to ke tu ninga natango ovanamwenyo.
Nomomambolongodjelo edu, oto tu kufa mo vali.

Nelaka lange nali udife ouyuki woye efiku alishe;
osheshi ava, va li va halela nge oudjuu,
ova fifwa ohoni ndele va ninipikwa.

72:
Oyo nai kale i nomwenyo.
Yo nai etelwe oingoldo yaSheba, yo i indililwe alushe;
nai nangekwe noupuna kuvo efimbo alishe.

73:
Ndelenee ame mwene
hanga eemhadi dange da punduka;
mokukatuka kwange lunga ndi fenungute po.

Otava pu po ngaashi ondjodi
tai vilavila momunhu mokupenduka kwaye;
oto kanifa efano lavo mokupenduka.

Ndelenee okukala popepi naKalunga, osho elao lange;
elineekelo lange onde li tula mOmwene Kalunga,
opo ndi hepaulule oinenelonga yoye aishe.

74:
Yukifa omanha oye koikuluputu yonale;
akutu, omutondi okwa pulungusha po
oinima aishe yomouyapuki.

Ovatondi voye otava ulile
meni longulu yoye yokwoongalela;
ova dika mo oiulikilifo yokumonikifa efindano lavo.

Oove ou, wa pangelela edu eengaba, di li dingilile;
okwenye nokulombo nokufu,
Oove omushiti wayo.

77:
Efiku lokuhangika koudjuu ohandi kongo Omwene;
eke lange onde li yelula oufiku, noinali loloka;
ndelenee omwenyo wange otau anye okuhekelekwa.

78:
opo i shiivike komapupi aa taa shikula,
kounona ava, tava ka dalwa,
vo va fikame yo, ve i hepaululile ovana vavo;

navo ve lineekele Kalunga,
vaha dimbwe oinenelonga yaye,
ndelenee va diinine oipango yaye;

Ndelenee efufyo alike la li momakanya avo,
ndele tave mu popile oipupulu
nomalaka avo;

Ehandu laye okwe li pitifa mo ine li kelela,
neemwenyo davo ine di kufa mefyo,
okwe di yandja moudu womuku;

79:
Ndelenee fye, ovanhu voye needi doufita woye,
otwa hala tu ku hambelele fiyo alushe;
nomapupi okomesho ohatu a udifile efimano loye.

80:
Ove owe u ningilile onhele yokutandavela kokule,
u shiive okuninga omidi,
ndele wa yadifa oshilongo;

82:
Ndele vo ihava koneke sha, ihava shipulula;
hava endaenda momilaulu,
omakanghameno aeshe edu taa tengauka.

Heeno, Ame mwene onda tya:
onye amushe ookalunga
novana vaau wOkombadambada;

84:
Omwenyo wange tau djuulukwa,
ndele tau lilile omikala dOmwene;
omutima wange nolutu lange
otali nyakukilwa Kalunga omunamwenyo;

Osheshi Kalunga Omwene,
Oye etango noshikelelifo;
Omwene oha yandje ouwanghenda nefimano;
ava tava ende moshili,
ite va kelele nande osha shiwa.

86:
Diinina omwenyo wange;
osheshi aame omuyuki;
Kalunga kange, xupifa omupiya woye,
ou te ku lineekele!

Hafifa omwenyo womupiya woye;
osheshi omwenyo wange
ohandi u yelulile kwoove, Omwene.

Osheshi ouwanghenda woye
we u ningila nge, ounene;
Ove wa xupifa omwenyo wange moshovafi.

88:
Ame nda valelwa nokuli
mongudu yaava tava i meembila;
ondi li po oshimenhu, shihe na vali eenghono.

Omesho ange otaa twikifwa koudjuu;
keshe efiku ohandi ku ifana, Omwene,
omaoko ange ohandi a aneke kwoove.

89:
Osheshi Oove etumbalo lavo nepameko lavo,
molwoku tu hokwa kwoye oluvinga letu
ola yeluka pombada;

opo nee eliteeko lavo,
Ame ohandi li va alulile noshokoto
noku va dengela owii wavo;

Ndelenee nande pa li ngaha,
Ove we tu ekelashi nowe tu taataela kwi,
nomuvaekwa woye to mu udile onya;

91:
Ote ku tuvike nomalwenya aye,
nomomavava aye omo to hondama;
oudiinini waye, owo oshikelelifo neameno.

92:
Osha wapala unene okupandula Omwene,
nokwiimbila edina loye ehambelelo,
Ove ou wOkombadambada;

Heeno, oshili, ovatondi voye, Omwene,
ovakondjifi voye shili otava nyonauka po;
ovaningi vowii aveshe otava halakanifwa.

Ndelenee oluvinga lange
oto li tumbifa pombada ngaashi olomhanda,
owa vaeka nge nomaadi mapelela;

93:
Omwene Oye ohamba! Okwe lidika etumbalo;
etumbalo Omwene e lidjala,
ekwamo laye olo eenghono;
nongonga yedu alishe owe i pameka yo,
ihe linyengaanyenge.

96:
Osheshi Omwene omunene,
noku nokufimanekwa pombada,
oha tilika komesho yookalunga aveshe;

97:
Ovafimaneki aveshe voihongwafano,
ava tave litadele oikalunga, ove li po va fifwa ohoni;
oifimanekwa aishe otai wile po eombe koshipala shaye.

99:
Omwene Oye Ohamba, oiwana yoilongo ohai kakama.
Olukalwapangelo laye oli li kombada yovakerubi;
edu nali tengauke.

Oye e va popifa moshilemongudi;
vo ova diinina omahepaululo aye,
noipango ei Ye e va pele.

101:
Omesho ange inandi hala oku a talifa oinima ilengifa;
ohandi tondo okuliikifa omatauluko,
aha ehene kwaame a kanyatele nge.

Omesho ange otaa tale ovadiinini vomoshilongo,
vo va kale pwaame;
omweendi wondjila ya yuka, oye na kalele nge.

102:
Efiku alishe ovatondi vange ohava yeele nge;
ava tava shivile nge olwoodi,
otava halele nge omupya.

103:
ndelenee apa pe fike oule weulu kombada yedu,
opo ope fike yo ounene wouwanghenda
waye kombada yaava have mu tila;

104:
ou, ho diki ongulu yoye momeva,
noilemo ho i ningi etemba loye,
noho ende nomavava omhepo;

oto li tuvikilifa omeva efuta ngaashi oshikutu;
fiyo okombada yeemhunda,
eyelu la li la hanga ko;

Ove ngeenge to i pe, yo otai toola;
ngeenge to kamutuluka eke loye,
otai likutifa nouwa.

105:
Vo eshi va li okangudu kanini,
ke vahapu nande,
ndele va li mo ovanailongo;

okwa taula emanya, ndele tali di omeva
taa kungulukile poshi,
ndele taa tondokele momatunda ngaashi omulonga;

106:
Ndelenee inava kalela kudimbwa
oinenelonga yaye,
nomhangela yaye inave i telamena;

107:
opo nee moudjuu wavo
ova kuwila kOmwene onghuwo,
ndele Ye okwe va xupifa momatilo avo;

opo nee moudjuu
ova kuwila kOmwene onghuwo,
ndele Ye e va xupifa momatilo avo;

ova tumbilwa keulu kwi,
ndele tava filukile mokule mwi,
fiyo eemwenyo davo da nyengwa molwetilo;

Opo nee moudjuu wavo
ova kuwila kOmwene onghuwo,
ndele Ye e va xupifa momatilo avo;

okwa lotifa oshikungulu,
pa pepa okamhepo kawa,
nomandudumo omakufikufi okwa mwena;

ndele tava kunu oilya
ndele tava twike oixwa yomiviinyu,
edi da ima da eta oshishipo;

108:
Omwene, onda hala oku ku tanga
mokati koiwana yoilongo,
onda hala ndi ku imbile komaludi ovapaani;

Moab oshiyaxa shange shokulikoshela,
kombada yaEdom ohandi ekele ko eenghaku dange;
nohandi nyakukilwa Filistia.”

109:
Osheshi omakanya eemhote novanaipupulu
okwa akamena nge,
ova popifa nge nelaka lekonda;

Owii wooxe nau kale,
hau dimbulukiwa kOmwene,
noulunde waina inau kwenywa po;

Ndelenee Omwene, Kalunga kange,
Ove, ninga omupopili wange molwedina loye;
molwounyenye wonghenda yoye xupife nge!

Eengolo dange oda tengaukifwa
kokulidilika eendja,
olutu lange ola kumbala, onda ngona;

ndele ame mwene onda ninga oshiyolifa shavo;
ngeenge tava mono nge,
otave lipukaapukile nge komitwe.

110:
Odibopangelo yeenghono doye,
Omwene ote i aneke, e li muSion;
pangela mokati kovatondi voye.

111:
Oye okwa dika oshidimbulukifo
shoikumwifalonga yaye;
Omwene Oye omunamutimanghenda nomunalukeno.

Oshiwana shaye okwe shi tumina ekulilo,
nehangano laye navo okwe li dika li kalelele;
edina laye oliyapuki nola tilika.

Okutila Omwene oko efina lounongondunge,
aveshe ava tava kala mulo, otava nongopalelele;
efimano laye ohali kala fiyo alushe.

112:
Ovana vaye otava ka kala
ovanaenghono moshilongo;
oludi lovayuki otali ka punikwa.

shaashi ye iha tengauka nande;
okudimbulukiwa kwomuyuki
otaku kala alushe.

Eenghundana dii ye ite di tila;
omutima waye itau mbadapala,
owe lineekela Omwene.

Ta yandje neke lakamutuluka,
neehepele ohe di pe oshali;
ouyuki waye otau kala po alushe;
oluvinga laye otali yeluka pombada
la tumbalekwa.

Omulunde ote shi mono,
ndele tashi mu twifa ondubo;
ota kwesha omayoo ndele ta xulu po;
omahalelo ovadinikalunga ihaa wanifwa,
taa kala ongaho.

115:
Omaoko ayo ihai a kwatifa sha,
omaulu ayo ihai a katukifa;
mominino dayo, ihamu di ondaka.

116:
Ondi hole Omwene,
osheshi oha udu ondaka yange
nokwiilikana kwange;

okutwi kwaye, oko okwe ku endekela nge;
onghee nda hala oku mu ifana
omafiku ange aeshe.

Omiyo defyo okwa li da yula nge,
noutile woshovafi owa hangelela nge;
onda hangikile koupyakadi noluhodi.

Heeno, Ove wa xupifa omwenyo wange mefyo,
nomesho ange aha lile,
nomhadi yange iha fenungute;

118:
Ova li va kondekela nge ngaashi eenyiki,
va xula po ngaashi omundilo womakiya;
medina lOmwene onde va hanauna po.

119:
Konekife nge ondjila,
ei nda udikilwa komalombwelo oye;
opo ndi dilakane oikumwifalonga yoye;

Ovalundakani otava sheke nge oixuna yongaho;
ndele ame momhango yoye
inandi tumhakana mo nande.

Omalulo ovakolokoshi taa dingilile nge;
nande ndi li ngaha,
itandi dimbwa nande omhango yoye.

Ovalinenepeki ova totela nge oipupulu;
ndelenee ame ohandi pashukile
omalombwelo oye nomutima aushe.

Yandja ovalinenepeki, va fifwe ohoni,
osheshi otava fininikile nge poshi oshimha;
ndele ame ohandi diladila omalombwelo oye.

Oipango yoye aishe oyo oshili;
otava shindifa nge oipupulu yavo,
onghee kwafe nge!

Fiyo alushe inandi hala nande
okudimbwa omalombwelo oye;
osheshi owa tula nge nao omwenyo.

Ovakolokoshi aveshe kombada yedu
oto va kandwileshi ngaashi omaxu oivela;
onghee ame ondi hole omalongo oye.

130:
Akutu Israel, teelela Omwene!
Osheshi pOmwene ope nouwanghenda,
nekulilo puye oli yadi po ndoo;

132:
“Onhele ei oyo yokutulumukilwa kwange fiyo alushe;
moima omu, omo handi kala,
shaashi onda djuulukwa mo.

136:
Oye tuu, a denga oiveli yOvaegipiti,
osheshi alushe ouwanghenda waye
tau kala po;

nOvaisraeli okwe va pitifa mokati kavo,
osheshi alushe ouwanghenda waye
tau kala po;

neke la li li neenghono, nokwooko kwa tanganana,
osheshi alushe ouwanghenda waye
tau kala po;

Oye tuu, a taula Efuta Litilyana pokati,
osheshi alushe ouwanghenda waye
tau kala po;

novaIsraeli okwe va tokolifa mo mokati kalo,
osheshi alushe ouwanghenda waye
tau kala po;

Oye tuu, a taululifa ovanhu vaye mombuwa,
osheshi alushe ouwanghenda waye
tau kala po;

Oye tuu, a denga eehamba dinene,
osheshi alushe ouwanghenda waye
tau kala po;

Noilongo yado okwe i yandja efyuululo,
osheshi alushe ouwanghenda waye
tau kala po;

139:
hano opo nomulaulu inau laula pwoove,
noufiku ngeno tau ku minikile ngaashi omutenya;
nomulaulu ngeno kwoove ouyelele.

Ohandi ku pandula, eshi nda tungwa nda tungikika;
oilonga yoye oya longekeka,
nomwenyo wange otau shi shiiva nawa.

Ngeno ondi hetekele oku i vala:
omuvalu wayo, ou dule womawe ehekedu;
ngeenge handi penduka, natango opo ndi li pwoove.

140:
Omulundili ita ka mona, apa te likwatelele moshilongo;
omhote nai tewatewe kemonifo loixuna
kedengo nedengo!

143:
Omake ange ohandi a yelula kwoove;
omwenyo wange otau ku notelwa,
wa fa edu li nonghange. Sela

146:
Omwene omwaameni wovanailongo.
Oye omuyakeli weefiye nowovafiyekadi;
ndelenee Ye omutwali moxwati wondjila yeembudi.

147:
Ota yaumuna oshihemime
ngaashi omundele tau tokaulwa,
noshitwime ote shi undile poshi ngaashi omute;

148:
Aishe oyo nai hambelele edina lOmwene,
osheshi Ye okwa tonga,
opo yo oya holoka po;

Ovo tuu, nava tange edina lOmwene,
osheshi edina laye olo alike la fimana;
oshinge shaye ohashi mane ko eulu nedu.

6:
Opo nda tya: “Fiyo onaini Omwene?” Ye okwa nyamukula, ndele ta ti:
“Fiyo oilando tai ningi omaputu muhe na ovanhu,
nomaumbo muhe novanhu, nedu tali ka ninga ofuka;

3:
Eendjovo edi inda u ke di ingidile lwokoumbangalanhu ove u tye:
‘Aluka! Akutu oove nakuliteeka nge, Israel, Omwene ta ti;
Ame itandi ke mu didivala vali,
osheshi Aame omunanghenda, Omwene osho ta ti;
Ame itandi ka kala nda handuka fiyo alushe.

6:
“Hano, mu nokwiilikana ngaha:
‘Tate yetu ou u li meulu!
Edina loye nali yapulwe;

Ouhamba woye nau uye;
ehalo loye nali wanifwe
kombada yedu ngaashi yo meulu;

1:
Ye ota ningi omunene,
ndele Ye e nokwiifanwa Omona waau wOkombadambada.
Kalunga Omwene ote mu pe olukalwa louhamba waxe David;

3:
Ominino davo odo eembila da yeuluka,
nomalaka avo tava kotokele,
oudiyo wonhoka u li koshi yomilungu davo;

11:
Ndele Israel ashishe otashi ka xupifwa, ngaashi pa shangwa:
“Omumangululi ota ka dja muSion,
ndele ta ka kandula mo odinokalunga muJakob;

2:
Ondjovo ei oi shii okulineekelwa:
“Osheshi ngeenge twa fyeni pamwe naye,
ohatu ka kaleni yo tu nomwenyo pamwe naye;

1:
Ove owa kala u hole ouyuki ndele wa tonda oumbudi;
Onghee hano Kalunga, Kalunga koye,
e ku vaeka nomaadi ehafo u dule vakweni.”

12:
Ndele nye omwa dimbwa naanaa filu ekumaido tali popi kunye ngaashi ounona tali ti:
“Omumwange, ino dina ehandutekulo lOmwene,
ndele ino loloka ngee to hanyenwa kuye;
